WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:05.900
In a future where Mankind has colonized space...

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.020
<i>Our scattering sweat shall turn into song.</i>

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:09.150
<i>Our flowing tears shall turn into stars.</i>

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.900
<i>AKB0048.</i>

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.780
<i>We'll outstrip the stars to come see you!</i>

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.870
That's far enough!

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:25.750
What's the big idea?!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.000
Let us through!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.090
What sort of gathering are you headed for?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.130
Nothing really...

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.170
Don't play dumb!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.630
Indulging in entertainment is a grave felony.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.680
Now, let's see your ID!

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.760
Stop it!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.760
Leave us alone!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.100
Don't resist!

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.160
What was that?

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.870
Nothing. Must have been rats.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.880
That was close!

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.300
Yeah. My heart jumped into my throat!

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.140
Here.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.810
Thank you, Yuuka!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.060
Nagisa!

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.820
But Chieri, is this "live entertainment" really worth it?

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.440
You'll know once you see it.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.910
It's a radiance that you'll never forget.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.490
That sounds kinda scary.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.370
Oh, Orine.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.160
Don't worry. I'm here for you!

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:50.210
AKB0048!

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:48.880
It's starting!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.130
There's no mistaking it!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.300
It's true! They came to see us!

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.240
I've been waiting, I've been waiting,

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.240
I've been waiting, yes!

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.280
I've been waiting, I've been waiting,

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.870
I've been waiting, yes!

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:23.990
<i>Yes!</i>

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:27.120
For you!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:34.630
I pedal my bike with all my might

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:39.550
as I make my way up this hill.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:44.720
Even my shirt, blown by the wind,

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.930
So <i>this</i> is entertainment...

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.390
Oh no!

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:44.310
Orine?

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.890
I feel funny inside. Why?

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.640
is only getting in my way.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:57.570
I've finally come to terms with how I feel,

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.940
Amazing!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.660
so I'll be honest from now on.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.740
<i>I'll be honest from now on.</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:08.290
This is the only path for me,

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:14.500
so here I go!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.250
They're angels!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.590
If you're in love, then just say so.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.670
<i>...then just say so.</i>

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.260
Don't try to hide it. Be true to yourself.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:24.350
<i>Don't try to hide it. Be true to yourself.</i>

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:29.180
If you're in love, then just say so.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:34.480
Let it all out in your heart!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.150
I've been waiting, I've been waiting,

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.110
I've been waiting, yes!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:38.690
Mwah!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.160
I've been waiting, I've been waiting,

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.240
<i>I've been waiting,</i>

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.070
I've been waiting, yes!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:43.610
<i>Yes!</i>

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.580
For you!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.120
I've been waiting!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.090
Multiple bogeys detected on radar!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.840
They're unmanned fighter craft from DES!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.170
So, they're finally here.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.300
Strengthen the shield at once!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.180
Launch the Guardian Angels!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.270
Takamina!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.020
Mariko-sama?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.270
It's not just an aerial attack.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.520
Ground forces are approaching, too!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.480
Can you go for one more song?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.530
Roger that!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:28.620
sora ni chirabatta hoshi no

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:28.620
I wonder which of the stars in the sky

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:34.710
dore ga ichiban ni kagayaku no darou

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:34.710
glows brightest of them all.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:40.590
kikaretemo daremo kitto kotaerarenai

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:40.590
You can ask anyone, and they won't know,

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:49.310
kurayami no saki ni koko kara mienai hikari ga aru

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:49.310
but beyond the darkness, a new light awaits us.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:55.390
suteeji no katasumi de mogakitsuzukeru

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:55.390
In the corner of the stage, I struggle on.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.060
Oh no!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.310
Why you...

00:04:55.390 --> 00:05:03.570
kuyashisa ya munashisa mo seishun no toki

00:04:55.390 --> 00:05:03.570
The pain and disappointment are all a part of my youth.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.940
Take this!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:08.910
shoujotachi yo mousugu yoake ga kuru

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.240
Nyan-Nyan!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:14.500
yume no mirai wa kore kara hajimaru

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:14.500
We've barely begun on the road to our dreams.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.870
Hi!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:11.450
All right!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.370
It's showtime!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.120
<i>Thump. Thump.</i>

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:21.250
shoujotachi yo nanimo akirameru na

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:21.250
Stand up girls! There's no reason to lose hope.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.630
<i>Down in my chest,</i>

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.130
<i>I feel the beat.</i>

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:27.130
kanashii koto nanka subete sutete

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:27.130
Shake yourself free from all your sadness.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.180
<i>My heart is singing with the music!</i>

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:33.310
zenryoku de zenryoku de

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:33.310
With all our might,

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.300
A Kirara!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.220
<i>It's crying out with the music!</i>

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.350
hashiru nda

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.350
we'll take off running.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.360
The Kirara?

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.070
They keep coming!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:48.990
This is too much!

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.000
Takamina! The fans are in danger.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.910
Roger!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:06:00.420
shoujotachi yo mousugu yoake ga kuru

00:05:55.080 --> 00:06:00.420
Stand up, girls! The dawn is nearly here.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:56.660
Hey!

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.420
Let's make the last verse count!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:06.010
yume no mirai wa kore kara hajimaru

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:06.010
We've barely begun on the road to our dreams.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:12.760
shoujotachi yo nanimo akirameru na

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:12.760
Stand up girls! There's no reason to lose hope.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:18.640
kanashii koto nanka subete sutete

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:18.640
Shake yourself free from all your sadness.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.820
zenryoku de zenryoku de

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.820
With all our might,

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.190
Wow!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.150
Amazing!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.860
hashiru nda

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.860
we'll take off running.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.910
Bye-bye!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.040
I want, more than anything, to join them!

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.960
To join AKB0048.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:47.210
Me too!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.380
Me three!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.430
Me four!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.390
Stellar Calendar Year 0048
Lancastar

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.320
<i>Ever since that day,</i>

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.820
<i>the factories have continued to spew the same heavy, black smoke.</i>

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.950
<i>The mines still chew the mountains to dust.</i>

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.670
<i>However,</i>

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:31.800
<i>the beating I felt in my heart that day still sounds as strongly as ever!</i>

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.260
<i>I've been waiting,</i>

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.350
<i>Yes!</i>

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.770
- Eternal Dreams-

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.230
Here on Lancastar, where entertainment has long been forbidden,

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:48.400
an uproar was caused four years ago by AKB0048's guerilla concert.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.280
Public opinion shifted in favor of entertainment,

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.070
and pro-entertainment activism reached its peak.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:00.080
Thus, the government made provisions

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.120
allowing entertainment under certain restrictions.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.910
Look.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.540
What?!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.590
What is it, Motomiya?!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.920
Nothing!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.470
Return to your seat immediately!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.130
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.310
Orine-chan certainly works hard.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.690
She doesn't have any family left, does she?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.110
And she's only thirteen, the poor thing...

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.740
Orine-chan! We're done for the day.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.070
Well? Are you getting the hang of things?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:37.990
Y-Yes!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:43.290
I'm still having some trouble,
but I like operating machines.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.080
It's fun!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.080
Really?

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:45.880
Yes!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.710
Here. This is for you.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.000
Though I'm afraid it's only leftovers.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.880
Thank you so much! I'll save it for later!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.720
Oh, that's my phone.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.930
I'm sorry! I thought I had it on silent.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:02.310
We're out back, hurry!!
AKB0048
77th gen. auditions!!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.860
Do you have it yet, Yuuka?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.730
Hold on. I'm still searching for the application site.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:13.320
Can I—

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.900
Not with crumbs on your hands!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.700
S-Sorry!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.280
Found it! This is it.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.330
Here we go.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.240
It's 0048!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:29.790
Sign: 77th Generation Stellar Auditions

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:25.870
Greetings!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:29.880
I'm AKB0048's Takahashi Minami the 5th.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.250
Orine! Look, it's Takamina!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:32.710
Yeah!

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:33.550
Stay focused!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.050
Right!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.760
Okay, I'm playing it.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:42.720
We're currently recruiting our 77th generation of understudies.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.230
We are the idols who come to see you.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:50.690
We'll brave planets where entertainment is forbidden to sing for our fans.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:54.570
To pay respect to the original AKB members,

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.820
we've taken on their names and become their successors.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:02.370
You, too, can inherit the name of your favorite idol!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.450
It's Yuuko!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.620
Yuuko! Don't just butt in!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.000
We saw her live that time!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.000
Aw, sorry!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.500
She sure has grown.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.210
Who are <i>you</i> to talk?

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.340
We await your applications!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.260
We look forward to seeing your smiles!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:18.380
If your planet is under the Entertainment Ban, we accept digital applications!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.260
For your safety, be sure it's
encrypted before sending it!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.140
What do we do?

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.730
That's a good question.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:29.940
Hup!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.650
I'm going to apply!

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.400
Nagisa?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:39.320
Don't you remember? Yuuko said they were waiting for us.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.120
We have to go to them!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.710
<i>Our sweat carries our dreams,</i>

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:58.170
<i>which lie budding, in wait,</i>

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:04.140
<i>until the day our wishes blossom.</i>

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.890
Good job, Yuuka!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.190
Yeah! You sounded kinda like Mayuyu!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.440
Really?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.400
Come on, it's your turn, Nagisa.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.540
<i>I've been waiting... I've been waiting...</i>

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.000
<i>I've been waiting... Yes!</i>

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.540
<i>I've been waiting... I've been waiting...</i>

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.380
<i>I've been waiting... Yes!</i>

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.260
I'm sorry.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.550
I'm not used to singing. It's embarrassing.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.760
Are you serious?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:48.270
Even if you have the skills,
you won't pass at this rate.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.980
B-But she's shown how determined she is!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:53.940
You think so?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:54.690
Awesome!

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:57.520
Geez, Orine. You're too easy on her.

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.780
Nothing wrong with that!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.150
You're next, Orine.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.110
O-Okay. Then...

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.740
Hey, if we really pass the
auditions, what should we do?

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.660
I have my heart set on succeeding Mariko-sama.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.460
I-I'm thinking of... Sasshii.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.130
Really? You don't fit her image.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.100
Excuse me! I'm going on ahead.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.270
Whatcha up to?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:32.940
Practicing?

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.520
Yeah.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.400
The big game's coming up.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.110
Will the coach put you in?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.230
Who knows?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.340
Is that Yuuka's boyfriend?

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:44.760
She said they weren't official yet.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.910
Come to think of it, "I've Been Waiting" is about telling your crush you love them, right?

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:50.950
Yeah.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.710
Saying you love them...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:59.840
I wonder what it's like to fall in love with a boy.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.050
You think those two have kissed yet?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.430
What? K-Kissed?!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.930
It's nothing to get flustered about.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.140
I mean, I wouldn't mind doing it with you.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:09.890
What?!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.850
Smooch!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:15.520
Smooch, smooch, smooch!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.690
I-I'm...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.400
N-No!

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.480
I was just... kidding...

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.450
Sensei-sensei!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:36.080
The young girls have sent their wishes from the stars.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.040
Please, call upon the Holy Lyric.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:55.810
Goodness gracious! Keep eating those tomatoes and you'll turn red.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.810
But I love tomatoes!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:58.730
Nagisa.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.940
Yes, Daddy?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.360
I believe you hung a poster related to entertainment in your room.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.280
You went into my room?!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.990
This planet has yet to fully lift the Entertainment Ban.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.620
Take it down.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.790
What? But it was so hard to get my hands on!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:14.910
I had to send in—

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:15.450
Furthermore,

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.710
were you <i>singing</i> in your room earlier?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.880
If an Entertainment Administration official's daughter is caught singing, people will talk.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:23.960
Stop that at once.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.090
I'm done.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.050
Nagisa!

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.430
Leave her be.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.270
Stupid!

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:36.680
Stupid...

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.060
Stupid Daddy!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.940
They're so cute.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.200
I wonder if I can be an idol too.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.700
Nagisa, I'm coming in.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:59.330
The ribbons are so cute. I'd like to wear one.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.830
Just like these.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.040
Nagisa!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:02.710
Mommy!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.710
Eat these.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:09.970
You know that Daddy was just promoted to Bureau Chief.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.180
He's very conscious of the regulations right now.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.970
I don't care!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.930
It's Daddy's fault that I can't sing.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.810
When I sing at home, he yells at me.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.190
I can't even practice outside because of the curfew.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.280
Nagisa, try to understand how Daddy feels.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.530
What about how <i>I</i> feel?!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.360
Nagisa...

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.950
Mommy... so you're on Daddy's side.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.960
Bring down the plate when you're done.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.170
I don't want your rice balls.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.860
Oh my gosh. Oh my gosh!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.270
What is it, Yuuka?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.400
W-W-We...

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.280
We passed the first round of auditions!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.410
Which of us?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.360
All of us!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.580
Look! They sent us a digital ticket for the next round!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.840
I don't believe it!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.510
All three of us made it! It's a dream come true!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.010
Right, Nagisa?

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.340
Nagisa?

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.100
I don't think I can go.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:39.970
It's just not happening.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.890
But <i>you</i> were the one who suggested it!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.310
You said 00 was waiting for us!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.190
I'm happy we passed,

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:51.280
but there's no way Daddy will let me.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:57.200
And I know my singing needs work, so I won't pass the next round.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.080
Nagisa...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.330
Why are you backing out now?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.750
You're just a scaredy-cat!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.670
A big, old, stupid scaredy-cat!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.260
Wait, Yuuka!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:26.310
<i>It had always been my dream, too.</i>

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.060
<i>Always...</i>

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:41.910
Out of the question.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.120
How come?

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:48.540
Anti-entertainment radicals or DES forces might show up at that audition.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:49.920
But—

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.880
Looking for danger is a waste of time.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:54.840
A waste...

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:55.510
Dear...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.430
The Deep Galactic Trade Organization

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.430
Expanding control over entertainment

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.430
0048 came to see us.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:08.350
Four years ago, when entertainment was completely banned,

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.690
they knew how dangerous it was,

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.650
but they came anyway!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.530
N-Nagisa. What are you...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:20.030
Because of that concert, this planet has changed.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.490
If we don't do anything, <i>nothing</i> will change!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.330
And why is change necessary?

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.370
Nagisa!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.750
Leave her be.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.970
What's wrong with having dreams?

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.020
It's not like we've been selected yet!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.020
But that's your goal, isn't it?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.150
Well...

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.980
I love you,

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:04.240
but if you pass the auditions and become an idol, I don't think I will anymore.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.040
I'll pass, just you wait.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:15.500
When I join 0048, you won't be getting <i>my</i> autograph!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.550
Yuuka...

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.640
All clean.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.730
I liked this place.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:35.860
Of course, I wanted to go to
school with Nagisa and Yuuka.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.660
The people here were so kind to me.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:50.040
It helped me forget my loneliness.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:00.130
Someday, when the sakura bloom,

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.590
I'll come back to see you!

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.180
<i>Yuuka is right.</i>

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.560
<i>I'm just a scaredy-cat.</i>

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.400
<i>I didn't want to get hurt,</i>

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:22.490
<i>but Yuuka was willing to bear the pain.</i>

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.080
<i>My dream... Our dream.</i>

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:32.040
The dream that started here.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.880
<i>I...</i>

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.790
What's <i>her</i> deal?

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.340
Is she sleeping?

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.920
You'll catch a cold out here.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.090
Come on, Nagisa.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.600
She's hopeless.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.980
What do you think she'll do?

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.480
Will she really skip the auditions?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:03.070
You know, my dream was never to join AKB.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:09.240
It was for <i>all</i> of us to join, including you and Nagisa.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.040
Same goes for me.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.080
<i>I was trying to pretend I was asleep,</i>

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:22.300
<i>but before I knew it, I was asleep for real.</i>

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.760
<i>There, on the stage of my dreams,</i>

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:30.850
<i>Yuuka and Orine were standing, as members of AKB00.</i>

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:36.100
<i>When they sang and danced, they were so beautiful.</i>

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.190
<i>And seeing them without me...</i>

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.030
<i>Without me...</i>

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.070
Oh, look!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.950
Whoa! The stars!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.370
You don't see those often.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.740
They're beautiful.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.790
They really are.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.800
<i>I had to give up the poster.</i>

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.010
<i>It left a gaping void on the wall.</i>

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.930
<i>A void with nothing to fill it.</i>

00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:36.540
<i>I guess I have to.</i>

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:43.170
Nagisa.

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:45.210
Mommy.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:49.130
Um... I'm going to... um...

00:22:58.520 --> 00:22:59.640
Is this...

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:00.940
What do you think?

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:05.070
It's just like in the poster!

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:10.410
I had to rush, so it might not look perfect.

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:11.740
Mommy...

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:14.370
Thank you so much, Mommy!

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:33.640
Even if you reach out your hand,

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:33.640
sono te nobashitemo

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:32.090
<i>I love them.</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:40.140
you won't be able to reach it yet.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:40.140
ima wa ima wa todokanai yo

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:36.010
<i>I love Yuuka.</i>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:38.390
<i>I love Orine!</i>

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:43.230
Orbital-bound station

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:45.940
Our dreams still lie

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:45.940
bokutachi no yume wa

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:47.150
What's keeping Nagisa?

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:51.530
much, much further in the distance.

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:51.530
motto motto tooku ni aru nda

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:49.190
Just forget about that scaredy-cat.

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:52.910
<i>This town...</i>

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:55.410
Even the stars of the sky

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:55.410
yozora no hoshi datte

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.660
lie billions of lightyears away,

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.660
nanoku kounen no kanata

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:58.580
Where's Nagisa?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:04.580
shining beyond the shadows.

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:04.580
kurayami no saki ni kagayaku mono

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:00.660
Let her sleep a bit longer.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:01.670
Very well.

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:06.960
<i>and Mommy and Daddy, I love them all!</i>

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:10.800
Let me speak of hope,

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:10.800
kibou ni tsuite boku wa katarou

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:07.880
<i>And, above all...</i>

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:16.890
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:16.890
na mo naki shijin no you ni atsuku

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:15.100
you ni

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:16.890
atsuku

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:22.940
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:22.940
kimi ga namida ni kureteiru nara

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:28.400
then rather than consoling you,

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:28.400
nagusame yori mo yagate shiramu

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:28.530
<i>I... I...</i>

00:24:26.150 --> 00:24:27.320
yagate

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:28.400
shiramu

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:34.700
let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:34.700
sora wo katarou ka

00:24:29.780 --> 00:24:37.700
I love AKB0048!

00:24:42.040 --> 00:24:42.830
Nagisa!

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:50.210
Let me speak of hope,

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:50.210
kibou ni tsuite boku wa katarou

00:24:50.210 --> 00:24:56.390
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:24:56.390 --> 00:25:02.430
If you ever doubt yourself,

00:25:02.430 --> 00:25:08.360
just keep walking without hesitation.

00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:14.700
Let me speak of hope.

00:25:12.570 --> 00:25:13.650
Yuuka!

00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:20.040
Like a nameless warrior, someday,

00:25:17.820 --> 00:25:18.910
you ni

00:25:20.040 --> 00:25:26.460
I'll live for my dreams.

00:25:20.040 --> 00:25:26.460
yume wo kate ni shite

00:25:27.580 --> 00:25:29.790
Thank goodness, Nagisa!

00:25:29.790 --> 00:25:33.050
You had us worried!

00:25:34.470 --> 00:25:36.010
Let's go together...

00:25:38.510 --> 00:25:40.260
toward our dreams!

00:28:06.200 --> 00:28:08.620
Sonata's gonna join AKB, too!

00:28:08.620 --> 00:28:11.790
Y-You're auditioning for AKB, too?!

00:28:11.790 --> 00:28:14.330
Chieri is missing...?

00:28:14.330 --> 00:28:17.130
I <i>know</i> she does! There's no way she's forgotten our dream!

00:28:17.130 --> 00:28:18.550
Come on. Let's go.

00:28:17.630 --> 00:28:19.880
- The Chosen Lights-
